>Tina</span> <span property="familyName">Marshall</span>, <span property="honorificSuffix">Ph.D.</span></a></span>, <span property="author" typeof="Person" role="listitem"><a href="https://psychiatryonline.org/doi/10.1176/appi.ps.201300261#con3"><span property="givenName">Richard H.</span> <span property="familyName">Dougherty</span>, <span property="honorificSuffix">Ph.D.</span></a></span>, <span property="author" typeof="Person" role="listitem"><a href="https://psychiatryonline.org/doi/10.1176/appi.ps.201300261#con4"><span property="givenName">Preethy</span> <span property="familyName">George</span>, <span property="honorificSuffix">Ph.D.</span></a></span>, <span property="author" typeof="Person" role="listitem"><a href="https://psychiatryonline.org/doi/10.1176/appi.ps.201300261#con5"><span property="givenName">Allen S.</span> <span property="familyName">Daniels</span>, <span property="honorificSuffix">Ed.D.</span></a></span>, <span property="author" typeof="Person" role="listitem"><a href="https://psychiatryonline.org/doi/10.1176/appi.ps.201300261#con6"><span property="givenName">Sushmita Shoma</span> <span property="familyName">Ghose</span>, <span property="honorificSuffix">Ph.D.</span></a></span>, and <span property="author" typeof="Person" role="listitem"><a href="https://psychiatryonline.org/doi/10.1176/appi.ps.201300261#con7"><span property="givenName">Miriam E.</span> <span property="familyName">Delphin-Rittmon</span>, <span property="honorificSuffix">Ph.D.</span></a></span></span></span><a href="https://psychiatryonline.org/doi/10.1176/appi.ps.201300261#tab-contributors" class="to-authors-affiliations">Authors Info &amp; Affiliations</a></div><div class="core-self-citation"><div property="isPartOf" typeof="Periodical"><span class="heading">Publication</span>: <span property="name">Psychiatric Services</span></div><div class="core-enumeration"><a href="https://psychiatryonline.org/toc/ps/65/3"><span property="isPartOf" typeof="PublicationVolume">Volume <spa